            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.69</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Zoom while inpainting.</b> Pinch or use the toolbar to zoom up to 8x for precise masks; hold space to pan. The brush stays screen-sized, so zooming in paints finer strokes.</li>
<li><b>Replace understands instructions.</b> Phrases like "change this to a blue nail polish" now produce the object you asked for instead of removing it.</li>
<li><b>Full-size comparison.</b> Comparing two images now uses the whole window, same as the preview.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
